List of all code/scripts modified with this release (relative to v1.4.23)

Updated model version to v1.5.0
versions/build.ver
versions/run.ver

Updated documentatio
docs/relnotes.readme.v1.5.0 (new)

Modified scripts to account for changes

fix/
new fix files to support moving to unstructured meshes in 12 domains and 1 domain to a new higher resolution domain for SEW
new bathy_slope files to account for new runup points in new domains

ush/
scripts to account for stofs 2d global current
modified swanexe file to account for all swan/punswan changes due to domain change
python script changes to make sure python upgrade to 3.12 doesn't break code

parm/
added details of 20m bathy points for runup

ecf/
updated scripts to resolve Bigzilla 1178

sorc/
changes to resolve bugzillas, remove unnecessary library builds and adding O2 flags.
get_external script changes to account for new fix files


BUGAZILA FIXES:
1166 Better handling of 0 byte grib2 files from upstream in jnwps_rtofs_prep job
PR https://github.com/NOAA-EMC/nwps/pull/46 is merged 

1089 jnwps_post_cgn didn't fail with a FATAL ERROR
PR: https://github.com/NOAA-EMC/nwps/pull/51

1174 executable names should match the sorc directory structure
PR:  https://github.com/NOAA-EMC/nwps/pull/44 

1163 - jnwps_estofs_prep does not abort after the job fails
 PR https://github.com/NOAA-EMC/nwps/pull/46
  
1170 -check all flag to makefiles
PR https://github.com/NOAA-EMC/nwps/pull/48 is merged. Complete?  YES

1178 - Use dynamic job number (-n) setting for aprun and cfp
PR: 

1158 Remove ".ecf" from file extension of NWPS ex-scripts
Done - resolved before. 

364 Remove GOTO statements
Not started, we will work on auxiliary fortran codes not the swan source codes as it need significant changes, this is agreed in a meeting with Steven Earl and NCO.
Rip current has no go-tos, 
Runup has no go-tos. External building of degrib, gd and emapf-c has also been removed which reduced the goto statements. 


What changes were made to the above code/scripts to support the new architecture?
changes can be tracked on github, and are also listed above

Were any other changes made that aren’t directly related to the transition?
No

Are there any changes to incoming data needs or outgoing products? 
Yes, dependence on stofs 2d global currents as upstream data

